    "Scan of the 1978 edition of the Walnut Hill, Florida, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1981; field checked in 1975; photo inspected in 1981; photo revised in 1984; last revised in 1984; printed in 1990.",
